  SpeakerName: 'True Ending: A Proper Magic Show'
  SpeakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 69db653b1f999eb44866dccb33e341e1, type: 3}
  DialogueText: You clasp your hands together with a golden light seeping through
    your fingers, before thrusting them upward and outward, sending the coins flying.
    You then cross your arms back up, with icicles piercing through each of the coins.
    Finally, you bring your hands back down and the icicles rapidly explode one-by-one.
    The boy cheers, and you're both impressed by the magnificent display.
